{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "55f835e6-43f9-8b3b-b47e-cb1bc7a2321b",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T10:09:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joel Semedo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:06:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:06:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good morning. My name is Joel Semedo. I am calling about a problem on my street. I have written it down, so please excuse me if I read."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:06:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, take your time. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:06:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. There is a big hole in the road. It is at 117 Spring Street, in the Fifth Ward. I am the neighbor there, I live close to that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:06:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 117 Spring Street, a hole in the road. Got it. How big are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:06:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is wide, maybe as wide as a car tire, and deep. After the nor'easter last weekend, Saturday into Sunday, it is filled with water. Now it is hard to see. A car can go in and not see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:07:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the problem with those, the water hides how deep they are. So, filled with water, hard to see. Is it in the travel lane or off to the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is in the lane, near the middle. Cars go around it, then they swing close to the crosswalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there a crosswalk right there too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. This is the second thing. The paint on the crosswalk is faded. It is almost gone. Cars do not stop for people. I see this every day, and people walk fast because they are afraid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:07:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so faded crosswalk, drivers not yielding. I'll put that in the same report so the crew sees both things at once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. That is good. Please, I would like to ask that the street be added to the repair list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can add Spring Street to the list. I'm writing it down now. Hole near the middle of the lane at 117, full of water, plus the crosswalk paint worn off. Anything else on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] One moment. Let me look at my paper. No, I think that is all for the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I hear a radio or something in the background, is that okay on your end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sorry. It is my grandfather's old radio. It is playing in the next room. I can close the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, you're fine, I just wanted to make sure I wasn't hearing a bad line. Can I get a good number in case the crew needs to check the exact spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one six seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-seven. Perfect. And that's Joel Semedo, S-E-M-E-D-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Joel, J-O-E-L."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:07-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the crew will look at it once they work through the post-storm list. There's a lot of damage around town right now, so it may be a few days to a couple of weeks before somebody gets out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days to two weeks. Okay. And in the meantime, is there something to put by the hole? So nobody drives in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag it as a hazard because of the water, so they may send someone to cone it off sooner. I can't promise that, but it's in the note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I understand. Thank you very much for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Joel. Thanks for calling it in. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
